Subject: [PATCH] cli: follow room geometry and fit resizable topology panes

Keep the read-only layout bridge outside native ownership. Match devices by
identity, retain actual association edges, and expire source/arrival cues.
Fit occupied groups without changing their orientation and share an accessible
pane divider with the room viewer.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [interactive virtual-radio laboratory]

